      <titleblock next-project="hs-objects">The Freaky stage</titleblock>

      <block layout="text-right">
        <text>
          <p>The "Freaky stage" is a miniature stage with a band in action.</p>
          <p>It was used (among other things) to display the final song of our 2026 stage production (amateur theater group Quasi playing "Not just
            Freaky", written and directed by Tanja&#160;Mensink, March/April 2026).</p>
          <p>An AI-generated dramatic song concluded the performance. The song is in Dutch, with subtitles present.</p>
          <p>In the same play, another device of me was used: <a href="neon-wave.html">the Neon Wave</a>.</p>
        </text>
